=== gunc
--- gunc 
check 	validate environment and input files before running
download_db 	download GUNC db
merge_checkm 	merge GUNC and CheckM outputs
plot 	create interactive visualisation
run 	run chimerism detection
summarise 	re-score genomes using a different contamination cutoff
--- gunc download_db -db 
gtdb_214 
gtdb_95 
progenomes_2.1 
--- gunc rescore --
--contamination_cutoff=	alternative cutoff to use
--gunc_detailed_output_dir=	GUNC detailed output dir (e.g gunc_output)
--help 	show this help message and exit
--max_csslevel_file=	maxCSS output file from GUNC (e.g GUNC.progenomes_2.1.maxCSS_level.tsv)
--output_file=	file in which to write output with rescored pass.GUNC column
--verbose 	verbose output for debugging
