=== vamb
--- vamb 
bin 	VAMB and TaxVAMB binners
recluster 	reclustering using single-copy genes for the binning results of VAMB or TaxVAMB
taxometer 	refines taxonomic annotations of any metagenome classifier
--- vamb bin 
default 	default binner based on a variational autoencoder
taxvamb 	taxonomy informed binner based on a bi-modal variational autoencoder
